{"lines":[{"x":0.21193415513910238,"h":0.013250883392226243,"c":1,"t":"Test 3","y":0.10747938757983211,"w":0.053497943878173831},{"c":1,"x":0.25094598688998798,"h":0.016627818310920639,"t":"play, the means are more important than the ends. It is freely chosen, spontaneous and","w":0.64215616861979163,"y":0.14866829765603862},{"t":"voluntary. If a child is pressured, they will likely not think of the activity as play. Play is","w":0.65868235270182296,"x":0.24884884618268302,"h":0.018744226058043378,"y":0.16352302365515659,"c":1},{"x":0.24886308713421482,"h":0.018482463239078872,"t":"actively engaged: Players must be physically and\/or mentally involved in the activity. Play","y":0.17955753796453722,"w":0.6730585734049479,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"is non-literal. It involves make-believe.","x":0.25080998963722295,"y":0.19335970655527346,"h":0.016055268309001169,"w":0.2947366333007812},{"h":0.018806702397035413,"c":1,"x":0.20974383110426145,"t":"According to this view, children's playful behaviors can range in degree from 0% to 100%","w":0.67308308919270832,"y":0.22502561227863371},{"x":0.20977116622250927,"y":0.24024835479591,"w":0.72246317545572925,"h":0.018459942371741311,"c":1,"t":"playful. Rubin and colleagues did not assign greater weight to any one dimension in determining"},{"t":"playfulness; however, other researchers have suggested that process orientation and a lack of","c":1,"w":0.69152709960937497,"h":0.01770991627543772,"y":0.25561972188303139,"x":0.20978597887575062},{"y":0.27144651973256084,"t":"obvious functional purpose may be the most important aspects of play (e.g. Pellegrini 2009).","w":0.69367212931315114,"x":0.20770173772840544,"h":0.018766614377007218,"c":1},{"h":0.016081806066039039,"c":1,"y":0.30228963989231272,"x":0.20979150608528471,"t":"From the perspective of a continuum, play can thus blend with other motives and attitudes that","w":0.7038634745279948},{"x":0.20768278187681555,"w":0.69367726643880212,"t":"are less playful, such as work. Unlike play, work is typically not viewed as enjoyable and it is","h":0.019258389062960068,"y":0.3171919131204799,"c":1},{"w":0.72238484700520833,"y":0.33356907775323175,"h":0.018476186287276763,"t":"extrinsically motivated (i.e. it is goal oriented). Researcher Joan Goodman (1994) suggested that","x":0.20772972963836689,"c":1},{"y":0.34794678927602496,"w":0.70402964274088542,"h":0.019217096874654893,"t":"hybrid forms of work and play are not a detriment to learning; rather, they can provide optimal","x":0.20968101886916241,"c":1},{"t":"contexts for learning. For example, a child may be engaged in a difficult, goal-directed activity","c":1,"w":0.70396845499674487,"x":0.2076866045196965,"h":0.019028192976197955,"y":0.36402729769783493},{"c":1,"x":0.2056608924281603,"w":0.71831090291341138,"t":"set up by their teacher, but they may still be actively engaged and intrinsically motivated. At this","y":0.37910388027288033,"h":0.01906464602556901},{"w":0.71011154174804691,"c":1,"y":0.39491653963191342,"t":"mid-point between play and work, the child's motivation, coupled with guidance from an adult,","x":0.20565315774002157,"h":0.01930236142431474},{"t":"can create robust opportunities for playful learning.","w":0.38714406331380213,"h":0.01799939069085188,"x":0.2056255046664002,"y":0.4094298884152987,"c":1},{"h":0.020101983078236629,"t":"Critically, recent research supports the idea that adults can facilitate children's learning while","c":1,"x":0.20764928533653479,"y":0.44004989179292964,"w":0.69371419270833334},{"h":0.018569994590588501,"y":0.45616312106988177,"x":0.20567631227874206,"w":0.70592702229817705,"c":1,"t":"maintaining a playful approach in interactions known as 'guided play' (Fisher et al. 2011). The"},{"c":1,"t":"adult's role in play varies as a function of their educational goals and the child's developmental","y":0.47177990823410876,"h":0.01937604933380388,"x":0.2056237786677019,"w":0.70805775960286466},{"t":"level (Hirsch-Pasek et al. 2009).","h":0.016164825718029352,"x":0.20353136590266113,"y":0.48685081620238557,"w":0.24521934509277343,"c":1},{"y":0.51737734395865309,"w":0.7122307840983072,"c":1,"t":"Guided play takes two forms. At a very basic level, adults can enrich the child's environment by","h":0.019756467659706511,"x":0.20560915443329472},{"w":0.7038585917154947,"h":0.016418494099862957,"x":0.20570108308789797,"t":"providing objects or experiences that promote aspects of a curriculum. In the more direct form","c":1,"y":0.53321929944630264},{"t":"of guided play, parents or other adults can support children's play by joining in the fun as a","h":0.017995797281972981,"w":0.67506322224934889,"c":1,"y":0.54921014000139645,"x":0.2056778836469953},{"y":0.56473818403784204,"w":0.69975713094075531,"x":0.20362567267669598,"c":1,"t":"co-player, raising thoughtful questions, commenting on children's discoveries, or encouraging","h":0.018219956801271864},{"w":0.65872055053710943,"x":0.20355129529621288,"h":0.01932864531751799,"t":"further exploration or new facets to the child's activity. Although playful learning can be","y":0.57916837289562095,"c":1},{"h":0.018894611174422815,"c":1,"x":0.20561123566954129,"t":"somewhat structured, it must also be child-centered (Nicolopolou et al. 2006). Play should stem","y":0.59405131327825578,"w":0.71016810099283856},{"w":0.20819244384765626,"y":0.60958297015981688,"h":0.014032746933935969,"c":1,"x":0.20559365141930006,"t":"from the child's own desire."},{"y":0.64048726202380735,"t":"Both free and guided play are essential elements in a child-centered approach to playful learning.","w":0.72455734252929704,"x":0.20356689475964032,"c":1,"h":0.01949662566887056},{"x":0.20351802776554934,"w":0.70611277262369798,"h":0.020388116825314939,"y":0.65554979917401912,"t":"Intrinsically motivated free play provides the child with true autonomy, while guided play is an","c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.71420013427734375,"x":0.20358601044125824,"y":0.68728781101428482,"h":0.017963016271872023,"t":"In either case, play should be actively engaged, it should be predominantly child-directed, and it"},{"w":0.094650204976399727,"t":"must be fun.","h":0.010306242638398078,"y":0.70347467623846371,"c":1,"x":0.20576131722373428},{"y":0.86337209284029515,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"x":0.20164609043257536,"t":"68","w":0.022633744875590028}],"w":2400,"h":3395}